One thing I have noticed, which has gotten me into trouble on occasion, is the
'y' key used for diagonal movement, is also the confirmation key for attacking
monsters.  This has produced unfortunate consequences in occasional characters
attacking *VERY* powerful things, which you *REALLY* didn't want to attack.  
It would be nice to be able to re-configure the confirmation/no-confirmation
keys for just these situations.

